// AI personalities (docs/18-ai.md, "Personalities and faction doctrine").
// Embedded in the game by gc_ai; only the host's AI reads them, so they are
// not part of the hashed game data and can be tuned freely.
//
// Traits run from 0 to 100. Field Battle reads these:
//   aggression   advances early instead of waiting, charges sooner
//   caution      needs a better expected result before it fights; falls back sooner
//   patience     how long it waits in a stand-off before it moves
//   cunning      prefers flanks and hammers to straight fights
//   opportunism  pounces on wavering and battered enemies
// The rest (greed, honour, vengefulness) are for Conquest and diplomacy.
//
// doctrines: preference for each battle plan, 0 to 100, on top of how well
// the plan fits the situation. army: the preset it builds for Field Battle
// (Balanced, Aggressive or Defensive).
